The '''Heart of the Mountain''', commonly abbreviated as '''HotM''', is a [[Skill Tree]] related to {{Skill|Mining}}. Leveling it awards perks and [[Token of the Mountain|{{DarkPurple|Tokens of the Mountain}}]], which can be spent on various Perks found within the tree.

__TOC__
== Unlocking ==
The {{HotM}} is unlocked by completing the [[Quests#There are Dwarves?|There are Dwarves?]] quest from {{NPCSprite|Rhys}} in the {{Zone|Obsidian Sanctuary}}, which requires giving him {{green|15}} of any enchanted [[ore]] and reaching {{Skill|Mining 12}}.

As players tier up their {{HotM}}, they will gain [[Token of the Mountain|{{DarkPurple|Tokens of the Mountain}}]], which can be used to unlock various perks. Some of these perks will take effect only on {{Green|Public Islands}} with a special mining mechanism (alongside an infinite Mining Fatigue effect).

