== Pickaxe Abilities ==
{{HotM}} {{purple|'''Tiers 2'''}}, {{purple|'''6'''}} and {{purple|'''10'''}} offer {{green|2}} {{Ability|Pickaxe Abilities}} each, for a total of {{green|6}}. 
*They can {{green|all}} be unlocked on the tree at once, but only {{green|one}} can be selected at a time.
*They are activated with {{Keypress|Right-Click}}, and have either an instant effect or a period of effect.
*Their name is misleading as they can be used while holding a [[Mining Tool]]: a [[Drill]], a [[Pickaxe]] or a {{Item|Gemstone Gauntlet}}.

