== Bugs ==
* With an active [[Pickaxe Ability|{{AN|Maniac Miner}}]] ability and using a [[Mining Tool]] that would otherwise have a {{stat|breaking power}} too low to break a given block, {{stat|Gemstone Spread}}{{ConfirmationNeeded|Not sure for gemstone spread}} and {{stat|Mining Spread}} do not apply.
* The {{stat|Mana Cost}} of {{AN|Maniac Miner}} [[#Pickaxe Abilities|Pickaxe Ability]] is consumed even after reaching the {{stat|Mining Fortune}} cap.
* At [[Heart of the Mountain#Perks list|{{DarkPurple|{{Abbr|CotM|Core of the Mountain}}}}]] level {{green|2}}, using a {{Item|Blue Cheese Goblin Omelette}} can bypass the cap of the [[Heart of the Mountain#Pickaxe Abilities|{{AN|Maniac Miner}}]] level {{green|3}} ability by {{stat|mnf|10}}, from {{si|mnf|500}} to {{si|mnf|510}}.
:At level {{green|3}} of [[Heart of the Mountain#Pickaxe Abilities|{{AN|Maniac Miner}}]], each block broken grants {{si|mnf|+15}}. The check for the cap is run after the incrementation. In practice, this gives: {{si|mnf|+15}} → {{green|'''PASS'''}} → {{si|mnf|+30}} → {{green|'''PASS'''}} → […] → {{si|mnf|+480}} → {{green|'''PASS'''}} → {{si|mnf|+495}} → {{green|'''PASS'''}} → {{si|mnf|+510}} → {{red|'''STOP'''}}.

== Trivia ==
*Reaching {{HotM}} Tier {{green|5}} will reward the player with the {{ach|Core of the Mountain|ach=true}}.
* [[2x Powder]] events also double [[Powder (disambiguation)|Powder]] obtained from the '''Daily Powder''' perk though the message does not reflect this. This is now affected by '''Powder Buff'''.
*All {{HotM}} Tier {{green|7}} perks cost the same amount of {{Gemstone Powder}}.
*Despite being impossible to get every single perk in the {{HotM}}, if one were to get all of them and max each one out (including '''Core of the Mountain'''), it would cost :
**{{Mithril Powder|12,808,220}};
**{{Gemstone Powder|32,550,666}};
**{{Glacite Powder|37,479,533}};
**or a combined amount of {{green|82,838,419}} {{Mithril Powder}}, {{Gemstone Powder}} and {{Glacite Powder}};
**{{green|45}} {{DarkPurple|Tokens of the Mountain}}.
*The {{HotM}} is a reference to the Arkenstone from J.R.R. Tolkien's ''[[w:The Hobbit|The Hobbit]]'' Chapter 4 (Over Hill and Under Hill).
**The Arkenstone is the biggest and rarest gemstone in the Lonely Mountain, and valued most by the Dwarves.
*'''Lonesome Miner'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s perk also affects {{Ench|Legion}}, {{Item|Superior Dragon Armor}}, {{Item|Ender Dragon Pet}}s and any other items that affects the buffed stats.
* The {{Item|Crow Pet|rarity=legendary}}'s {{AN|Insightful}} perk does not apply on [[Pickaxe Ability|{{AN|Maniac Miner}}]].
*The '''Maniac Miner''' perk is based on a team upgrade in Hypixel Bed Wars, which grants {{Potion|Haste 1}} and {{Potion|Haste 2}}.

